@startuml
title SSD 7 — Import and Export Availability CSV
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor AdministrativeStaff as Staff
participant ":System" as System
note over Staff,System: PoC starts empty; no database is loaded automatically.
Staff -> System: importAvailability(sourcePath)
alt unreadable file, invalid header/row, duplicate interval, or overlapping availability
  System --> Staff: importRejected, row/error details (no changes)
else all rows valid
  System --> Staff: imported slot count, professional count
end
note over Staff,System
UTF-8 CSV headers: First Name, Last Name, Title, Specialty, Date, Start, End.
Imports create/reuse professionals and explicit availability slots.
They do not create patients, bookings, resources or waiting-list entries.
end note
Staff -> System: exportAvailability(destinationPath)
alt destination cannot be written
  System --> Staff: exportFailed (domain unchanged)
else file written
  System --> Staff: exported slot count
end
note over Staff,System
Export includes the entire availability dataset, not only free slots.
This is an availability interchange, not a complete booking/patient backup.
The sample schema contains no booking-status or resource-allocation columns.
end note
@enduml
